      "hallucination_observed": false,
      "rationale": "A typed taxonomy of concrete product-failure modes is a genuine grouping axis for the 'which factors' part of the query. However it is dominated by 'not_present' (196 of ~250), reflecting that most rows here are media reviews with no hardware spec gap; this near-constancy weakens its leverage. Values seen are defensible: media/subjective reviews correctly mark 'not_present', so no invented specifics observed."
